// Demonstrates: an error inside a properly-opened <<if>>'s nested body is still caught, and the
// if/endif structure around it still closes correctly — the nested body is parsed by a recursive
// call to the same accumulate-and-continue logic, sharing this node's error list.
title: Start
speaker: Narrator
---
<<if $x == 1>>
<<sett $y = 2>>
<<endif>>
===
